@@ -69,3 +69,22 @@
 المشروع مهيأ للبناء على Android SDK 34 وGradle 8.9، لكن تشغيل `assembleDebug`
 يحتاج إلى تنزيل Android Gradle Plugin والتبعيات من الإنترنت.
 لا يُعدّ ملف المصدر المضغوط APK، ولا ينبغي إعادة تسمية ZIP إلى APK.
+
+
+## JARVIS Vision/SC v1.3
+- In **صلاحيات**, enable **Vision/SC** (off by default).
+- Android 11 (API 30) or newer: `read_screen` captures the active display/window using AccessibilityService.takeScreenshot and sends JPEG + accessibility tree to the chosen provider.
+- Screenshots are created in RAM on-demand, JPEG compressed to 2000px longest edge, never stored as local files, and removed from agent history immediately after the model request.
+- Android 8-10 use the existing accessibility text-only path; screenshot capture does not bypass secure windows.
+- Screenshot payload may include sensitive data and incurs vision API costs.
+- Supports OpenAI Chat Completions, Claude Messages and Gemini generateContent image parts.
+
+
+## JARVIS v1.4: advanced device controls
+- Screen understanding: accessibility tree, element bounds and status, optional on-demand Vision/SC screenshots (Android 11+).
+- Interactions: tap by coordinates/index/text, long-press, double-tap, drag, pinch zoom, directional or coordinate scroll, scroll accessible widgets, enter/replace/append/clear input.
+- Navigation: Home/Back/Recents/Notifications/Quick Settings, app launch, open URL and selected Settings pages.
+- Reliability: wait for on-screen text with timeout, read-screen verification, gesture completion timeout, immediate stop.
+- Device tools: battery/device status and clipboard write (no clipboard reading).
+- Safety: root shell command ALLOWLIST for read-only diagnostics; no arbitrary destructive shell execution. Irreversible actions require separate explicit user confirmation, and Android secured/protected windows are not bypassed.
+- This is user-initiated app control, NOT unattended, covert or unrestricted hardware/OS access.
